      <activity id="4059a439-49ef-5990-9983-0bfd5c428cd6" activityNameId="3f6e5019-7832-5a4d-8b52-91014b8e5e12" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Range extender, for hybrid passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Range extender, for hybrid passenger car
The construction of the datasets allows to change key parameters (like mass of the vehicle, mass of the battery, consumption, life times, etc.) in order to cover a wide spectrum of situations . However, it is important to consider that changing one parameter of a vehicle, e.g. its mass, may lead to changes in other parameters,  e.g. the consumption. When modifying the default parameters given, attention should be payed to the possible influence which one parameter may have over the other.;
UUID: ccf540cf-00de-3291-af51-0fcf52334a10
The assumed  range extender includes two components: a small internal combustion engine (with a weight of 114.9kg) and a small generator (25kW) with a weight of 32kg .
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The dataset is based on modern car technologies which are expected to be representative up to 2015.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling Procedure 
Extrapolations: Extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ccf540cf-00de-3291-af51-0fcf52334a10.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
